<title>UK: Innovative raises four mln stg via placing.</title>
<headline>Innovative raises four mln stg via placing.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Innovative Technologies Plc said on Wednesday that it has placed 1.56 million ordinary shares with institutional investors at 270p per share to raise around 4.2 million stg.</p>
<p>London Newsroom + 44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
